{"kind":"html","caption":"从左到右扫描数组，并用哈希表记录已经见过的“数值 → 下标”。处理当前元素前，先查找补数 target - nums[i]，这样不会重复使用同一个元素。示例中先记录 2 → 0，扫描到 7 时找到补数 2，得到下标 [0, 1]；时间复杂度为 O(n)，空间复杂度为 O(n)。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>两数之和可视化</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}\nhtml,body{margin:0;min-height:auto;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\n.panel{margin-top:8px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526}\n.panel-title{margin:0 0 6px;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;color:#d4d4d4}\n.rule{padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45}\n.mono{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace}\n.accent{color:#3794ff;font-weight:600}\n.muted{color:#8d8d8d}\n.row{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px;align-items:center}\n.grid2{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}\n@media(max-width:520px){.grid2{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.array,.chars,.row-wrap{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px}\n.cell,.char,.num-cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;padding:4px 2px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font:600 14px \"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;transition:.3s}\n.cell .idx,.char .index,.index,.marker{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:2px;font-weight:400}\n.cell.active,.cell.mid,.cell.current,.cell.found,.cell.max,.char.active,.num-cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.cell.out,.cell.discarded{opacity:.35}\n.card{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#2d2d30}\n.card-label{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-bottom:4px}\n.card-value{font-size:13px;font-weight:600;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff}\n.progress{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:8px}\n.dot,.pill{flex:1;height:3px;border-radius:2px;background:#3c3c3c;transition:background .3s}\n.dot.on,.pill.on{background:#3794ff}\n.pills{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}\n.pills .pill{flex:none;height:auto;padding:2px 7px;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;color:#8d8d8d}\n.pills .pill.active,.pills .pill.on{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.status{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;border-left:3px solid #3794ff;background:#2d2d30;border-radius:0 4px 4px 0;line-height:1.45;min-height:auto}\n\n.top{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:6px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:6px}\n.input{padding:2px 7px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;background:#252526;font-size:11px}\n.flow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}\n@media(max-width:520px){.flow{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\n.label{font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-bottom:4px}\n.array{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,38px);gap:4px}\n.array .cell::after{content:attr(data-index);font-size:10px;color:#8d8d8d;margin-top:2px}\n.calc{margin-top:6px;padding:8px 10px;background:#1c1c1c;border-radius:4px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45;min-height:auto}\n.map{min-height:48px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px}\n.entry{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:4px 8px;border-radius:4px;background:#2d2d30;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:11px}\n.empty{color:#8d8d8d;font-size:11px}\n.result{opacity:0;transition:.4s;padding:8px 10px;border-radius:6px;background:#0e639c;color:#fff;text-align:center;font-weight:600;font-size:12px;margin-top:8px}\n.result.show{opacity:1}\n\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>哈希表一次扫描</h1>\n<p class=\"lead mono input\" style=\"display:inline-block\">nums = [2, 7, 11, 15] · target = 9</p>\n<div class=\"flow\">\n<section class=\"panel\"><div class=\"label\">数组</div><div class=\"array\"><div class=\"cell\" data-index=\"0\">2</div><div class=\"cell\" data-index=\"1\">7</div><div class=\"cell\" data-index=\"2\">11</div><div class=\"cell\" data-index=\"3\">15</div></div><div class=\"calc\" id=\"calc\">准备从左向右扫描……</div></section>\n<section class=\"panel\"><div class=\"label\">已见 值→下标</div><div class=\"map\" id=\"map\"><div class=\"empty\">哈希表为空</div></div><div class=\"status\" id=\"status\">先查补数，再记录当前元素。</div></section>\n</div>\n<div class=\"result mono\" id=\"result\">找到答案：[0, 1]</div>\n<p class=\"lead\" style=\"text-align:center;margin-top:6px\">O(n) 时间 · O(n) 空间</p>\n</main>\n<script>\n\nconst cells=[...document.querySelectorAll('.cell')],calc=document.getElementById('calc'),map=document.getElementById('map'),status=document.getElementById('status'),result=document.getElementById('result');\nconst wait=ms=>new Promise(r=>setTimeout(r,ms));\nfunction reset(){cells.forEach(c=>c.className='cell');map.innerHTML='<div class=\"empty\">哈希表为空</div>';calc.textContent='准备从左向右扫描……';status.textContent='先查补数，再记录当前元素。';result.classList.remove('show')}\nasync function play(){reset();await wait(900);cells[0].classList.add('active');calc.innerHTML='当前值 <span class=\"accent mono\">2</span>，需要的补数：<span class=\"mono\">9 - 2 = </span><span class=\"accent mono\">7</span>';status.innerHTML='哈希表中没有 <span class=\"mono\">7</span>，暂未配对。';await wait(1500);map.innerHTML='<div class=\"entry\"><span>2</span><span>→ 0</span></div>';status.innerHTML='记录 <span class=\"mono\">2 → 0</span>，继续扫描。';await wait(1400);cells[0].classList.remove('active');cells[1].classList.add('active');calc.innerHTML='当前值 <span class=\"accent mono\">7</span>，需要的补数：<span class=\"mono\">9 - 7 = </span><span class=\"accent mono\">2</span>';status.innerHTML='查询哈希表：正在寻找 <span class=\"mono\">2</span>……';await wait(1400);cells[0].classList.add('found');cells[1].classList.add('found');status.innerHTML='命中 <span class=\"mono\">2 → 0</span>，当前下标是 <span class=\"mono\">1</span>。';calc.innerHTML='<span class=\"mono\">nums[0] + nums[1] = 2 + 7 = </span><span class=\"accent mono\">9</span>';result.classList.add('show');await wait(2600)}\n(async()=>{while(true)await play()})();\n\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":"","time_complexity":"O(n), 平均","space_complexity":"O(n)","complexity_note":"n 为数组长度. 一次扫描, 哈希查找和插入按平均 O(1) 计; 哈希冲突退化时最坏时间 O(n²). 哈希表最多记录 n 个元素."}
